# Operator Core UI

Compose [shadcn/ui](../skills/shadcn-ui/SKILL.md). Do not reimplement Button, Input, Select, Card, Badge, or Alert.

Tokens: [Operator Core designMd](../skills/shadcn-ui/references/operator-core.md). Ignore Stitch Material `namedColors` (`#faf8ff`, `#005c55`) and the YAML `colors:` dump in `designMd`. Mapping: [stitch-to-shadcn](../skills/stitch-to-shadcn/SKILL.md).

- Campaign widgets: `components/campaigns/`. Do not assemble `app/(auth)/campaigns/new` on isolated component stories.
- Density: chips 20px / 4px; controls 32px or 36px / 6px; cards 8px / `#E2E8F0` border. Prefer borders over shadows.
- Status: emerald verified, amber attention, rose guardrail. Primary actions `#0F766E`.
- Stitch glyphs → lucide (`Store`, `MapPin`, `ShieldAlert`, `X`). Do not use a Material icon font.
- Compose `Label` + control. Do not invent `Field` or a one-off `<textarea>` / `<button>` when `Textarea` / `Button` belong in the registry (CLI-add Alert/Textarea if missing).

```tsx
// BAD — one-off control + Material canvas
<button className="h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#005c55]">Save</button>

// GOOD — registry + Operator Core
<Button className="h-8 rounded-[6px] bg-[#0F766E] hover:bg-[#115E59]">Save as Draft</Button>
```
